{"id":"e8c6112440a637e4","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence.md","title":"de Jongh–Sambin 受保护不动点存在定理","display":"thm-gl-fixed-point-existence — de Jongh–Sambin 受保护不动点存在定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence","aliases":["72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence"],"display":"thm-gl-fixed-point-existence — de Jongh–Sambin 受保护不动点存在定理","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]","[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Theorem4.3, print484/PDF496","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source statement checked; general existence proof not reproduced","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-fixed-point-existence — de Jongh–Sambin 受保护不动点存在定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a77c8090d251f76a\" href=\"?note=a77c8090d251f76a\" title=\"72-df-modal-guarded-context\">72-df-modal-guarded-context</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Theorem4.3, print484/PDF496"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source statement checked; general existence proof not reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\operatorname{pv}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\operatorname{pv}_m\\)</span> 与单变量代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a77c8090d251f76a\" href=\"?note=a77c8090d251f76a\" title=\"72-df-modal-guarded-context\">72-df-modal-guarded-context</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3fd94ba56d864509\" href=\"?note=3fd94ba56d864509\" title=\"72-df-godel-lob-logic\">72-df-godel-lob-logic</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\ \\bigl[\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\setminus\\{i\\}\\land\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\ \\bigl[\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\setminus\\{i\\}\\land\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项核对原书 Theorem 4.3：变量必须受方框保护；输出不含指定变量，且不得引入原式没有的其他变量；等价在 GL 内可证。原书此处将一般证明指向 de Jongh、Sambin 等文献，本轮没有取得或重做这些一般存在性证明。因此本节点记录书中定理的精确陈述，保留禁止作为已核验证明依赖的标记；不能用唯一性证明冒充存在性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","status":"resolved","id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","status":"resolved","id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 与单变量代入取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]；$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 取 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","status":"resolved","id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 与单变量代入取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]；$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 取 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\operatorname{pv}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\ \\bigl[\n\\operatorname{pv}_m(B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\setminus\\{i\\}\\land\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(B\\leftrightarrow_m A[B/p_i])\\bigr].","display":tr